@startuml
!include https://static.visual-paradigm.com/web/resources/plantuml-stdlib/themes/vp.puml

title Order - Confirm Order Item

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activityFontName Arial
skinparam activityFontSize 14
skinparam activityBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderThickness 2
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  BorderColor #2563EB
  DiamondBackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  DiamondBorderColor #2563EB
  StartColor #111827
  EndColor #FFFFFF
}

|Seller|
start
note right
Precondition:
The seller is signed in and approved.

Postcondition:
The line is CONFIRMED and can go into a shipment.
end note
:Choose to confirm a line;
:Submit the confirmation;
|System|
if (The system fails while processing the request?) then (Yes)
  :Return the system error;
  |Seller|
  :View the system error;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Check the line is the seller's and PENDING;
if (The line is unknown, another seller's or not PENDING?) then (Yes)
  :Return the confirm error;
  |Seller|
  :View the message;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:For a VNPAY order, check the order is paid;
if (The VNPAY order is not paid?) then (Yes)
  :Return the not-paid error;
  |Seller|
  :View the message;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Move the line to CONFIRMED;
|Seller|
:View the result;
stop

@enduml
